      section: "\xA7 6655(e)(1), (2)(A)",
      url: "https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/26/6655",
      excerpt: `Installment #${q.n}: annualize taxable income for the ${q.periodLabel.split(",")[0]} period, take 21 percent, apply the ${q.pct.num}% applicable percentage, subtract earlier installments, and cap at installment# \xD7 25% of the required annual payment minus earlier installments (the \xA7 6655(e)(1)(B) recapture, telescoped). [The \xA7 250 deduction and credits are not annualized; the elective alternative monthly periods of \xA7 6655(e)(2)(C) are not modeled \u2014 disclosed. Exact cents.]`
