      excerpt: "\u2026the lesser of (i) 90 percent of the tax shown on the return for the taxable year\u2026 or (ii) 100 percent of the tax shown on the return of the individual for the preceding taxable year. If the adjusted gross income\u2026 for the preceding taxable year exceeds $150,000 [$75,000 married filing separately], clause (ii) shall be applied by substituting '110 percent'."
